接原因是那个定时任务的数据库连接池配置了无限等待超时，任务中间遇到一次网络抖动后，连接处于半死状态，事务既没提交也没回滚。根本原因是这个任务半年前从另一个团队迁过来时，没人审查过连接池参数和异常处理逻辑。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**三条改进建议：**\\n\\n1. **所有数据库连接池强制配置事务超时时间**（我们定为60秒），超时自动回滚，杜绝孤儿事务。在基础库层面统一拦截，不依赖业务代码自觉设置。\\n\\n2. **批量任务与在线业务做物理隔离**——定时任务走独立的数据库账号和连接池，配合`pt-kill`脚本对超过阈值的长事务自动告警并终止。\\n\\n3. **补充锁等待监控看板**，对`information_schema.INNODB_TRX`中运行超过30秒的事务做实时告警，把问题暴露在影响用户之前。\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4.6\",\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":132,\"completion_tokens\":770,\"total_tokens\":902}}","base64Encoded":false,"specificRequestHeaders":{"Authorization":"Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI3MTUzNyIsImVtYWlsIjoiZmVpamlkZmc1NUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsIm5hbWUiOiJmZWlqaWRmZzU1IiwiZXhwIjoxNzgwNTUwNjMzLCJpYXQiOjE3Nzc5NTg2MzMsIm5iZiI6MTc3Nzk1ODYzM30.4ISBUM6WwA3vMEuq52gTck7VKjueXfXHYlMiVdUHnNo"},"specificResponseHeaders":{"cf-ray":"9f6d50d20949764e-NRT","date":"Tue, 05 May 2026 05:24:14 GMT"},"keyRequestHeaders":{"Authorization":"Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI3MTUzNyIsImVtYWlsIjoiZmVpamlkZmc1NUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsIm5hbWUiOiJmZWlqaWRmZzU1IiwiZXhwIjoxNzgwNTUwNjMzLCJpYXQiOjE3Nzc5NTg2MzMsIm5iZiI6MTc3Nzk1ODYzM30.4ISBUM6WwA3vMEuq52gTck7VKjueXfXHYlMiVdUHnNo"},"keyResponseHeaders":{}}],"captureStartTime":1777958605946,"captureEndTime":1777958669890,"totalDurationMs":63944,"settingsUsed":{"maxCaptureTime":180000,"inactivityTimeout":0,"includeStatic":false,"urlInclude":[],"urlExclude":[],"bodyUrlInclude":[],"bodyUrlExclude":[],"disableCache":true,"captureAllResponseBodies":true,"maxResponseBodyBytes":0,"maxRequests":80},"remainingCaptures":[],"totalRequestsReceived":2,"requestLimitReached":false,"redactionApplied":"off","backend":"debugger","needResponseBody":true,"redaction":"off"}